# Copy to .env. Model tag to pull + serve (https://ollama.com/library).
# 4GB VRAM (RTX 3050) ceiling: ~4B params at q4. Bigger spills to CPU = slow.
MODEL=qwen3:4b

# Context window. 16384 fits qwen3:4b in 4GB alongside weights; raise on
# bigger GPUs (the agent's ARIA snapshots are large — more is better).
CONTEXT_LENGTH=16384

# Only for cloud-only tags (glm-5.2:cloud etc.) — inference runs on
# ollama.com, this container is just the proxy. Key: https://ollama.com/settings/keys
#OLLAMA_API_KEY=
